---
// src/components/ConsultingCTA.astro
//
// Mark 28 — explicit owner policy amendment: Consulting's existing,
// already-published category-level content (src/pages/consulting.astro) is
// elevated to a homepage section, immediately after the hero section. This
// is a real status change, not just a copy addition — consulting.astro's
// own posture and copy were updated in the same pass (see
// src/lib/hub-routes.ts's PostureLabel and src/pages/consulting.astro) to
// stop asserting "no engagement pathway is active," since this section's
// CTA now provides one. The exact headline/subhead/CTA copy below is the
// owner's own, given verbatim.
//
// Signal Green (--ff-accent-signal) on the primary button is a deliberate,
// explicit exception to Mark 19's original "restricted to exactly two uses
// site-wide" accent-restraint rule (see src/styles/global.css's `.btn--accent`
// comment, updated in this same pass) — the button routes to /contact, the
// same real intake path the original rule's "Contact Intake button" use
// case describes, just from a second entry point. No other new element on
// this site uses the accent.
---

<section id="consulting-cta" class="section consulting-cta">
  <div class="wrap consulting-cta-inner">
    <p class="consulting-cta-eyebrow">CONSULTING</p>
    <h2 class="consulting-cta-headline">Systems for people who move.</h2>
    <p class="consulting-cta-subhead">
      Texas Movement Consulting builds AI-powered operating systems for founders and institutions.
      Diagnostic intake available for qualified operators.
    </p>
    <div class="consulting-cta-actions">
      <a class="btn btn--accent" href="/contact">
        Request Diagnostic Brief <span class="arrow">→</span>
      </a>
      <a class="consulting-cta-secondary" href="/consulting">View Consulting Architecture →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .consulting-cta {
    background: var(--paper);
    border-block: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .consulting-cta-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .consulting-cta-eyebrow {
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }

  .consulting-cta-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    max-width: 24ch;
  }

  .consulting-cta-subhead {
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .consulting-cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .consulting-cta-secondary {
    font-family: "IBM Plex Mono", monospace;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .consulting-cta-secondary:hover {
    border-bottom-color: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
